  positions: float -73.52*4=-294 vs C++ -292; startpos 23.81*4=95 vs 92).
- int16 C++ model verified bit-exact vs float quantization conventions
  (int16 acc, ReLU, ow x512, ob x32768; Python q-model matched 92/-124/-296
  vs C++ 92/-120/-292, diff = C++ trunc-toward-zero vs floor).
